{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Security - Events - Okta Threat Suspected on an Authentication Request",
	"Description": "Okta marked an authentication request as threatSuspected. Unlike security.threat.detected this rides along on an ordinary authentication event, so it catches requests Okta was suspicious of but still processed.\n\nField: debugContext.debugData.threatSuspected == true\n\nReference(s):\n- https://help.okta.com/en-us/content/topics/security/threat-insight/okta-threatinsight-overview.htm\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/",
